sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant UI as ScannerScreen
    participant SF as ScanFlowProvider
    participant YOLO as YoloDetector (Isolate)
    participant FR as FoodRepository
    participant DB as Cloud Firestore

    User->>UI: Ambil foto makanan via kamera/galeri
    UI->>SF: detectFood(imageBytes)
    SF->>YOLO: Isolate.run(_preprocessImage & TFLite)
    YOLO-->>SF: List<RawDetection> (bbox, class, conf)
    SF->>FR: Match detected classes with food DB
    FR-->>SF: List<DetectionItem> (mapped nutrition)
    SF-->>UI: Display DetectionConfirmationScreen
    User->>UI: Confirm items & input portion grams
    UI->>DB: set(users/{uid}/meals/{mealId}, mealData)
    DB-->>UI: Success & Cached locally
